 C/A6:,NAME,
C===========================================================
C C/A6 - write the M10 characters packed in ACC, padded to a
C plain integer field width at [SP-1].  The old P/A6 tagged the
C character count before subtracting the width; both are plain here.
C===========================================================
 C/SP:,SUBP,
 C/6A:,SUBP,
 ,ITS,13                     . Push packed characters; ACC := M13
 ,ITS,10                     . Push return link; ACC := count
 15,ATX,                     . Push M10
 ,NTR,7                      . Plain P2C integer arithmetic
 15,A-X,-4                  . ACC := character count - width
 13,VJM,C/SP                 . Print width-count leading spaces
 15,XTA,                     . Pop saved M10
 ,STI,10                     . Restore M10; pop M13
 ,STI,13                     . Restore M13; pop packed characters
 15,UTM,-1                  . Drop the caller's width argument
 ,UJ,C/6A                    . Tail-call the unpadded writer
 ,END,
